  (text "3. IO-LINK MASTER PHY (MAX14819A ×2)" (at 520.00 120.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (bold yes)) (justify left)) (uuid "59194ea1-b6f9-4594-914c-39f3dfcabda3"))
  (text "Rectangular IC symbols are appropriate here; these vendor-specific ICs are not stock KiCad symbols. SPI/IRQ go to the controller header." (at 520.00 128.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.88 0.88)) (justify left)) (uuid "c6907fbf-bf8e-49a3-b82b-96bd2cdab9db"))
  (text "4. BANNER Q20NDXL NPN ×3 — COMPLEMENTARY BLACK / WHITE OUTPUTS" (at 20.00 430.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (bold yes)) (justify left)) (uuid "5b29f5a8-87ab-49b3-9657-d48410c2e6ea"))
  (text "NPN outputs use 3.3V pull-ups, series/RC filtering, test points, and high-impedance transistor-buffered debug LEDs." (at 20.00 438.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.88 0.88)) (justify left)) (uuid "682958f6-b4ec-4757-bd53-92bc29e74059"))
  (text "Brown +V" (at 18.00 477.81 0) (effects (font (size 0.72 0.72)) (justify left)) (uuid "0095c5e4-8d17-40ed-ba19-2e255572eda3"))
  (text "Blue 0V" (at 18.00 475.27 0) (effects (font (size 0.72 0.72)) (justify left)) (uuid "3f399f1d-bba3-4761-b2e5-6dc8ce5c3d28"))
  (text "Brown +V" (at 18.00 562.81 0) (effects (font (size 0.72 0.72)) (justify left)) (uuid "695d3e68-2f96-42d7-b8fb-fc3fb5b93c9b"))
  (text "Blue 0V" (at 18.00 560.27 0) (effects (font (size 0.72 0.72)) (justify left)) (uuid "0f57f189-07cc-4e43-b1dc-5358d4d10811"))
  (text "Brown +V" (at 18.00 647.81 0) (effects (font (size 0.72 0.72)) (justify left)) (uuid "724a5f83-7a14-48a3-9875-c9a65eeac692"))
  (text "Blue 0V" (at 18.00 645.27 0) (effects (font (size 0.72 0.72)) (justify left)) (uuid "384b946c-1a87-4b38-8b51-251a3757b233"))
  (text "5. JSUMO ML1 LINE SENSORS ×4 — ANALOG" (at 390.00 430.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (bold yes)) (justify left)) (uuid "f52517d9-3dda-40a8-ba86-f20b4bf16e9e"))
  (text "Powered at 3.3V. Each OUT uses a 1k / 10nF low-pass and a test point; no LED is placed on analog paths." (at 390.00 438.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.88 0.88)) (justify left)) (uuid "c7a5857f-059b-4c75-bd59-f59547c2c7c7"))
  (text "VCC" (at 395.00 486.54 0) (effects (font (size 0.72 0.72)) (justify left)) (uuid "35ae1ad8-a8e8-4f47-b76c-df04d8bc025f"))
  (text "GND" (at 395.00 484.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.72 0.72)) (justify left)) (uuid "d91245d4-482b-415d-8dd6-8eedd1b00a4d"))
  (text "VCC" (at 395.00 556.54 0) (effects (font (size 0.72 0.72)) (justify left)) (uuid "49fa612f-3ae8-4c50-bcf0-4a31bb5edd71"))
  (text "GND" (at 395.00 554.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.72 0.72)) (justify left)) (uuid "32e94364-bbf4-4e52-b070-c050478b8e66"))
  (text "VCC" (at 395.00 626.54 0) (effects (font (size 0.72 0.72)) (justify left)) (uuid "71503e49-0df6-4073-aaea-8f66ca7ef012"))
  (text "GND" (at 395.00 624.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.72 0.72)) (justify left)) (uuid "3c1dd27f-384d-4c02-bb74-705c359dd731"))
  (text "VCC" (at 395.00 696.54 0) (effects (font (size 0.72 0.72)) (justify left)) (uuid "48cb9cc1-1beb-4187-8cdb-69b102fb8e38"))
  (text "GND" (at 395.00 694.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.72 0.72)) (justify left)) (uuid "2547dc84-41b5-48b7-ae2e-26ff27c92569"))
  (text "6. DRIVE — CYTRON MDD20A + 2 × BRUSHED DC MOTORS" (at 590.00 470.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (bold yes)) (justify left)) (uuid "a6f8774e-a773-4577-be05-06aa91e84da3"))
  (text "Motor symbols are stock KiCad Motor:Motor_DC. The MDD20A remains a custom module symbol because it is a vendor module, not a stock IC." (at 590.00 478.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.88 0.88)) (justify left)) (uuid "d3a8b40e-eec8-4415-a91e-0d68aa8887df"))
  (text "7. CONTROLLER INTERFACE — NO TEENSY SYMBOL INCLUDED" (at 900.00 470.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (bold yes)) (justify left)) (uuid "14dfda95-5e2b-4e3d-b193-b68b02613ade"))
  (text "All controller-facing logic is 3.3V. Choose GPIOs with the capability shown by each signal name/notes." (at 900.00 478.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.88 0.88)) (justify left)) (uuid "134bf8db-ef3d-4f1c-abdc-1db05f49ec06"))
  (text "Pin 2 (+5V) is optional module power. Pin 3 (+3V3) is the logic reference; do not back-drive it." (at 900.00 635.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.82 0.82)) (justify left)) (uuid "bc8a62ed-3554-4785-87d5-702ee0b73477"))
  (text "Baumer/Banner: digital GPIO input; interrupt-capable preferred." (at 900.00 644.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.82 0.82)) (justify left)) (uuid "8901a2a9-55d9-49da-8425-1b8ae90004ff"))
  (text "LINE_*: ADC-capable input, 0–3.3V." (at 900.00 653.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.82 0.82)) (justify left)) (uuid "9f29742a-6a7f-4029-86aa-9d3659d59e9e"))
  (text "IOLINK_*: hardware SPI; CS_A and CS_B are separate GPIO outputs; IRQ_A/B interrupt-capable inputs." (at 900.00 662.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.82 0.82)) (justify left)) (uuid "0d168c86-2632-44ba-8c66-679936c44058"))
  (text "MOTOR_*_PWM: hardware PWM output (≤20 kHz for MDD20A). DIR: ordinary digital output." (at 900.00 671.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.82 0.82)) (justify left)) (uuid "02a08709-f7be-4709-a165-d4e995a121f1"))
  (text "1 +5V optional" (at 925.00 712.81 0) (effects (font (size 0.78 0.78)) (justify left)) (uuid "1eaf5c14-2c26-44c6-8582-282220c50a2d"))
  (text "2 GND" (at 925.00 710.27 0) (effects (font (size 0.78 0.78)) (justify left)) (uuid "41482217-db5b-49a4-ab9b-c9a061031c0c"))
  (text "3 Controller TX -> ESP RX" (at 925.00 707.73 0) (effects (font (size 0.78 0.78)) (justify left)) (uuid "4ea1afb6-0a41-4414-92e3-0dbbe747d087"))
  (text "4 Controller RX <- ESP TX" (at 925.00 705.19 0) (effects (font (size 0.78 0.78)) (justify left)) (uuid "89c2af71-0da3-4a97-8b6d-80179b1c31c6"))
  (text "DESIGN / FABRICATION NOTES" (at 900.00 760.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25) (bold yes)) (justify left)) (uuid "7e8e2614-c86b-45de-b319-e6c7696a3456"))
  (text "• External sensors and motors are represented by connectors/motor symbols; exact footprints depend on harness/mechanics." (at 900.00 770.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.78 0.78)) (justify left)) (uuid "3dc9e936-3600-4881-a78e-c074b2a84f33"))
  (text "• Verify MAX14819A footprint, crystal load caps, IO-Link protection, 3PDT switch pinout, and regulator module footprints before PCB layout." (at 900.00 779.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.78 0.78)) (justify left)) (uuid "ed36aac4-17d4-4c36-8cda-1cb4e5ab7a6c"))
  (text "• Keep motor current paths short/wide and separate from sensor/analog returns. Use keyed XT60 polarity and an appropriately rated fuse." (at 900.00 788.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.78 0.78)) (justify left)) (uuid "a1b77750-4417-43f6-8b2c-7d7e76264d58"))
